        "text_KKca6r": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The team behind Ōra King is a collective of lifelong fish farmers, scientists, and stewards of the Marlborough Sounds, all working under the heritage-rich New Zealand King Salmon Company. Over decades, they’ve honed a selective breeding program to produce what many consider the “Wagyu of the Sea.” Each fish reflects the expertise of farmers who observe carefully and manage every stage of the life cycle, from hatchery to harvest.</p>",
