            "heading": "Broiled Miso  Salmon Bowl",
            "text": "<p>This ritualistic recipe celebrates the art of a 48-hour marinade, blending saké, miso, and coconut sugar to create a deeply flavorful glaze. We'll guide you through every step—from preparing the marinade to broiling the salmon to perfection and plating it with sushi rice, purple broccolini, pickled onions, and creamy avocado.</p><p>👉🏽 <a href=\"https://seatopia.fish/blogs/seafood-recipes/broiled-miso-salmon-bowl-sushi-rice-avocado\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://seatopia.fish/blogs/seafood-recipes/broiled-miso-salmon-bowl-sushi-rice-avocado\">Get the Recipe</a></p>",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
