          }
        },
        "profile_tPnk6G": {
          "type": "profile",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2025-06-25_at_8.47.03_AM.png",
            "heading": "Salmon Poke Bowl",
            "text": "<p>Join us in this new recipe where we dive into the traditional flavors of Hawaii with a classic Salmon Poke, made with New Zealand King Salmon from Seatopia. This step-by-step guide walks you through preparing a flavorful poke, marrying the rich taste of sushi-grade salmon, with the freshness of pickled ginger and garlic, two classic poke partners. Perfectly paired with sushi rice and creamy avocado, this dish is a true celebration of Hawaiian cuisine and Hawaiian flavor at home.</p><p>👉🏽 <a href=\"https://seatopia.fish/blogs/seafood-recipes/salmon-poke-101-tamari-ginger-garlic\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://seatopia.fish/blogs/seafood-recipes/salmon-poke-101-tamari-ginger-garlic\">Get the recipe</a></p>",
            "color_text": "#ffffff",
            "color_background": "#171717"
          }
        }
